00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:32,500
Mother!

293
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:33,500
Mother!

294
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:35,539
Mother!

295
00:26:36,119 --> 00:26:36,759
Mother!

296
00:26:37,220 --> 00:26:37,720
Mother!

297
00:26:38,519 --> 00:26:39,019
Mother!

298
00:26:40,619 --> 00:26:41,180
Mother!

299
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:42,400
Pingjun,

