357
00:32:08,980 --> 00:32:10,759
Her brain was damaged too.

358
00:32:12,180 --> 00:32:14,180
She's breathing, but there's no

359
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,140
consciousness or movement.

360
00:32:16,519 --> 00:32:17,680
Basically, she's in

361
