369
00:32:55,220 --> 00:32:56,619
Whatever it takes.

370
00:33:19,519 --> 00:33:21,880
Young Master. With a condition like this,

371
00:33:22,259 --> 00:33:23,140
even the top hospitals

372
00:33:23,140 --> 00:33:24,240
