396
00:34:51,940 --> 00:34:53,639
My friend told me

397
00:34:54,079 --> 00:34:54,880
from now on,

398
00:34:55,539 --> 00:34:56,940
our ideological banner

399
00:34:57,639 --> 00:34:59,039
is Marxism.

400
00:35:00,739 --> 00:35:02,280
What's Marxism?

401
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:03,280
Marxism sees

402
00:35:03,519 --> 00:35:04,340
equality as

403
00:35:04,739 --> 00:35:06,119
one of society's

404
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:08,179
