405
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:11,079
Its core goal is to abolish class and

406
00:35:11,340 --> 00:35:12,340
exploitation. To free

407
00:35:12,440 --> 00:35:15,039
people from oppression and exploitation.

408
00:35:15,420 --> 00:35:16,219
To let the people

409
00:35:16,219 --> 00:35:17,679
collectively own the means of production

410
00:35:17,880 --> 00:35:19,619
and collectively wield state power.

411
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,000
That's a good idea.

412
00:35:22,920 --> 00:35:23,780
The October Revolution

413
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:24,980
brought Marxism

414
00:35:25,079 --> 00:35:26,000
into China.

415
00:35:26,420 --> 00:35:27,539
It lets us see clearly

416
00:35:28,019 --> 00:35:29,679
that the central government

417
00:35:29,739 --> 00:35:31,340
is really the rule of feudal warlords,

418
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:32,239
the landlord class,

419
00:35:32,239 --> 00:35:34,019
and the comprador bourgeoisie.

420
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:37,420
We must continue the revolution

421
00:35:38,219 --> 00:35:39,480
